01:15:37.683 --> 01:15:53.008
One Gito is back!

01:15:53.068 --> 01:16:00.463
Welcome, Pekwanchiru.

01:16:00.523 --> 01:16:01.834
Welcome, Jata.

01:16:01.894 --> 01:16:03.344
Thank you, Rono.

01:16:03.404 --> 01:16:04.905
It is good to be back.

01:16:04.965 --> 01:16:05.665
Yes.

01:16:05.725 --> 01:16:07.125
Home again.

01:16:07.185 --> 01:16:08.966
It is a good feeling.

01:16:09.026 --> 01:16:11.106
And Chiambo and Morithi.

01:16:11.166 --> 01:16:12.307
What happened to them?

01:16:12.327 --> 01:16:14.407
Morithi was arrested.

01:16:14.467 --> 01:16:16.788
Morithi's trial for murder.

01:16:16.848 --> 01:16:18.688
And Chiambo?

01:16:18.748 --> 01:16:21.169
He tried to escape from the police.

01:16:21.229 --> 01:16:25.760
And the police officer fired at him and shot him in the shoulder.

01:16:25.820 --> 01:16:28.318
And then he ran into the forest.

01:16:28.378 --> 01:16:29.476
I see.

01:16:29.536 --> 01:16:31.447
Did the police find him?

01:16:31.507 --> 01:16:32.408
No.

01:16:32.468 --> 01:16:34.819
Mumbi found him the next morning.

01:16:34.879 --> 01:16:36.220
Nearly well.

01:16:36.280 --> 01:16:37.850
He was dead.

01:16:37.910 --> 01:16:39.000
Dead?

01:16:39.060 --> 01:16:40.251
Yes.

01:16:40.311 --> 01:16:44.203
Mumbi said it looked as if he had been attacked by a lion.

01:16:44.263 --> 01:16:46.254
A real lion this time.

